@host = http://localhost:5080
@contractId = 33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333

GET {{host}}/api/customers
Accept: application/json

###
GET {{host}}/api/contracts/{{contractId}}
Accept: application/json

### Missing contract: 404 Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/contracts/99999999-9999-4999-8999-999999999999
Accept: application/json

### Malformed UUID: 400 Validation Problem Details
GET {{host}}/api/contracts/not-a-guid
Accept: application/json

### Development OpenAPI document
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json
